  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Response in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the long term needs of the people of Mozambique to the impact of drought exacerbated by the El Nino. This project will improve poor people access to a wide range of essential services in the short and long term including clean water, access to food short and long term and livelihoods. The programme will improve the sustainability of farmers to protect their crops against drought.</narrative>
  </description>
